claim.claim-text:
receiving, from a base station, downlink control information that indicates the LTE is to provide a one-shot feedback report for a set of one or more downlink transmissions, wherein each downlink transmission of the set of downlink transmissions includes one or more transport blocks and each transport block comprises a plurality of code block groups, and wherein the downlink control information includes a request for transport block level or code block group level feedback for the set of downlink transmissions;
determining feedback information at the transport block level or the code block group level for the set of downlink transmissions based at least in part on the request; and
transmitting, to the base station, the one-shot feedback report including the transport block level or code block group level feedback information.

transmitting a set of one or more downlink transmissions to a user equipment, UE, wherein each downlink transmission of the set of downlink transmissions includes one or more transport blocks and each transport block comprises a plurality of code block groups;
transmitting, to the LTE, downlink control information that indicates the LTE is to provide a one-shot feedback report for the set of downlink transmissions, wherein the downlink control information includes a request for transport block level or code block group level feedback for the set of downlink transmissions; and
receiving, from the UE, the one-shot feedback report that indicates the transport block level or the code block group level feedback for the set of downlink transmissions.

receive, from a base station, downlink control information that indicates the LTE is to provide a one-shot feedback report for a set of one or more downlink transmissions, wherein each downlink transmission of the set of downlink transmissions includes one or more transport blocks and each transport block comprises a plurality of code block groups, and wherein the downlink control information includes a request for transport block level or code block group level feedback for the set of downlink transmissions;
determine feedback information at the transport block level or the code block group level for the set of downlink transmissions based at least in part on the request; and
transmit, to the base station, the one-shot feedback report including the transport block level or code block group level feedback information.

transmit a set of one or more downlink transmissions to a user equipment, UE, wherein each downlink transmission of the set of downlink transmissions includes one or more transport blocks and each transport block comprises a plurality of code block groups;
transmit, to the LTE, downlink control information that indicates the LTE is to provide a one-shot feedback report for the set of downlink transmissions, wherein the downlink control information includes a request for transport block level or code block group level feedback for the set of downlink transmissions; and
receive, from the UE, the one-shot feedback report that indicates the transport block level or the code block group level feedback for the set of downlink transmissions.
